      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JADZIA (6) is promising filly set to resume for the Begg camp. Was thrown in the deep end in her debut prep, finishing a close second to Medicinal in the G3 Ottawa Stakes in her first start. Not as effective in the Breeders Stakes in testing conditions before spelling. Has jumped out well in readiness and keeps Beggy's main man Childs. Is expected to make a winning return. FOOFARAW (2) is a colt by Nicconi out of Stormy Road won debut for the Cumani yard. Strips fitter for a recent trial win and should run well. HURRICANE GIRL (5) is a three-year-old filly on debut for Dan O'sullivan. By Toronado from Lake District Girl. Has come along nicely at the jumpouts and any market moves need to be respected. BLUE SUEDE SHOES (4) is a three-year-old filly also on debut. From an elite family that includes a G1 victor, being by Blue Point from Blue Grass Music. Is another that has shown encouraging signs in her lead-up work.",
